[node name="DeviationLabel" type="Label" parent="Information/VBOX/Deviation"]
layout_mode = 2
tooltip_text = "Explanation:

Absolute Deviation measures how far apart the progress of both cars on the track is, measured on the track progress.

Positive values mean:
- the Tracked (real) Car is faster than Simulated Car

Negative values mean:
- the Tracked (real) Car is slower than Simulated Car

The nearer this value is to 0.00% the better the simulated car matches the real car."
mouse_filter = 0
text = "Absolute Deviation"

